Each report contains a diagnosis, and each
diagnosis names a suspect: a command in

2
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:14,079
the first, the server in the second. A
branch is a named line of commits, the saved

3
00:00:14,119 --> 00:00:18,451
snapshots of a project. git pull fetches
commits from the team's server and

4
00:00:18,491 --> 00:00:22,997
