228
00:15:59,447 --> 00:16:04,074
It distinguishes the reflog of a branch
from the reflog of HEAD and says when only

229
00:16:04,114 --> 00:16:08,514
one of them exists. It includes the
command for work that was staged and never

230
00:16:08,554 --> 00:16:13,181
